{"lang":"ko","dir":"ltr","title":"메뉴 | La Piñata Taqueria · Vallejo","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"../\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LP</span><span>La Piñata Taqueria</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"../\">홈</a><a href=\"../#visit\">영업시간 및 위치</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"언어\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\" selected>한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">주문</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"menu-hero\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <a class=\"back\" href=\"../\">← La Piñata Taqueria</a>\n  <h1>메뉴</h1>\n  <p class=\"menu-intro\">타코, 슈퍼 부리토, 토르타, 나초, 케사디야.</p>\n  <div class=\"menu-source\"><p>가격은 변동될 수 있습니다.</p></div>\n</div><div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div>\n<nav class=\"menu-chips\" aria-label=\"메뉴 카테고리\"><div class=\"wrap\"><a href=\"#m-tacos\">타코 (Tacos)</a><a href=\"#m-burritos\">부리토 (Burritos)</a><a href=\"#m-tortas-nachos-quesadillas\">토르타, 나초 &amp; 케사디야</a><a href=\"#m-drinks\">음료</a><a href=\"#m-extras\">추가</a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"wrap menu-body\">\n<section class=\"menu-sec has-img\" id=\"m-tacos\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>타코 (Tacos)</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">Taco</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$3.50</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">원하는 고기에 양파, 고수, 살사를 올려 드립니다.</p></li></ul><div class=\"menu-choices\"><b>고기 선택</b><ul><li>Asada (구운 소고기)</li><li>Al pastor (매콤한 양념 돼지고기)</li><li>Suadero (소고기)</li><li>Carnitas (찢은 돼지고기)</li><li>Pollo (닭고기)</li><li>Lengua (소 혀)</li><li>Cabeza (소 머리 고기)</li><li>Chorizo (매콤한 소시지)</li></ul></div></div><figure class=\"menu-img\"><img src=\"../images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"고수, 양파, 래디시, 당근을 올린 La Piñata 타코 한 접시\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></section><section class=\"menu-sec has-img\" id=\"m-burritos\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>부리토 (Burritos)</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">Super Burrito</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$16</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">원하는 고기, 밥, 콩, 치즈, 사워크림, 피코 데 가요, 살사.</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">슈퍼 채식 부리토</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$14</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">구운 양파, 구운 파프리카, 양상추.</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">슈퍼 새우 부리토</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$18</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">구운 양파와 구운 파프리카가 들어갑니다.</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">렝구아 부리토</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\"></span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">소 혀.</p></li></ul></div><figure class=\"menu-img\"><img src=\"../images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"포일 위에 반으로 자른 La Piñata 슈퍼 부리토\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></section><section class=\"menu-sec has-img\" id=\"m-tortas-nachos-quesadillas\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>토르타, 나초 &amp; 케사디야</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">Torta</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$16</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">원하는 고기, 사워크림, 치즈, 양파, 토마토, 할라피뇨, 아보카도, 양상추.</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">Super Nachos</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$16</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">원하는 고기, 콩, 사워크림, 모차렐라 치즈, 피코 데 가요, 할라피뇨.</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">Super Quesadilla</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$16</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">원하는 고기, 치즈, 피코 데 가요. 사워크림과 살사는 따로 드립니다.</p></li></ul></div><figure class=\"menu-img\"><img src=\"../images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"La Piñata의 칩, 레드·그린 살사, 당근 피클과 구운 할라피뇨\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>칩, 살사 &amp; 채소 피클</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"menu-sec\" id=\"m-drinks\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>음료</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">캔 탄산음료</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$2</span></div></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">멕시코 탄산음료</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$3</span></div></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">생수</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$1</span></div></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">Medio Litro</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$4</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">500ml 음료.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"menu-sec\" id=\"m-extras\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>추가</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">타코에 치즈, 사워크림 또는 아보카도 추가</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$0.25</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">개당.</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">부리토에 치즈, 사워크림 또는 아보카도 추가</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$1</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">개당.</p></li></ul></div></section>\n\n\n<div class=\"cta-row menu-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 전화 (707) 334-8381</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%2C%20809%20Broadway%2C%20Vallejo%2C%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 길찾기</a></div>\n</div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"wrap footer-in\">\n    <div><strong>La Piñata Taqueria</strong><br>809 Broadway, Vallejo, CA 94590 · <a href=\"tel:+17073348381\">(707) 334-8381</